            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 2,
              "bbox": [
                0.19,
                0.303,
                0.443,
                0.334
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Fig. 11.8: Using mirror to redirect sunlight on a wall"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.506,
            0.081,
            0.857,
            0.208
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Turn the shiny plate or mirror in different directions to redirect the light onto a wall or a nearby surface (Fig. 11.8). Do you see a spot of light on the wall? Does it mean that the shiny plate or mirror has changed the direction of light?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.507,
            0.212,
            0.857,
            0.34
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now, tilt the shiny plate or mirror in different ways and observe the light spot on the wall. Does it change position? Notice how light always travels in straight lines and changes direction when it falls on the shiny plate or mirror."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.271,
            0.345,
            0.858,
            0.437
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What conclusion do you draw from your observations? This activity suggests that a shiny surface or a mirror changes the direction of light that falls upon it. This change in direction of light by a mirror is called the "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "reflection of light",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ". Let us try to understand the reflection of light by a mirror."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.29,
            0.449,
            0.583,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity 11.6: Let us experiment"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
